<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>肠痈 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E8%82%A0%E7%97%88/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Thu, 02 Jul 2026 15:33:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E8%82%A0%E7%97%88/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>内治法：论肺痈 论肝痈 论肠痈</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/1-5-neizhifa/</link><pubDate>Tue, 21 Apr 2026 14:15:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/1-5-neizhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%80%E7%A4%BC%E9%9B%86/">卷一礼集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“内治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;肺痈、肝痈、肠痈&lt;/strong&gt;的内治方药与医理。核心观点是：内痈生于脏腑，火热邪毒内蕴，非大剂清解不能消散，故以&lt;strong&gt;金银花为君&lt;/strong&gt;，配伍归经之品，重剂煎服以从内消。</description></item><item><title>疮痈肠痈浸淫病脉证治第十八</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/jingui-18/</link><pubDate>Sun, 06 Jul 2025 15:10:24 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/jingui-18/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E9%87%91%E5%8C%AE/">金匮</category><description>&lt;p&gt;这一篇讨论疾病成因分为内因与外感二种。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;中医认定会致病的内因是过于喜、怒、忧、思、悲、恐等情志。另外一种是外因，来自风、寒、暑、湿、燥、热等。还一种属于外伤科，像是刀伤、摔伤、枪伤等，我们中药里有很好的金创药可治。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>